WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:02.850
In the year 845...

00:03.460 --> 00:08.690
the Colossal and Armored 
Titans suddenly appeared,

00:09.320 --> 00:13.210
destroying the wall, 
along with the life we'd known.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.580
Humanity abandoned Wall Maria,

00:19.160 --> 00:24.500
losing twenty percent of its population 
and a third of its territory,

00:24.850 --> 00:26.980
to retreat within Wall Rose.

00:29.880 --> 00:31.260
And in the year 850...

00:32.160 --> 00:36.640
The Colossal Titan reappeared 
and breached the wall.

00:37.090 --> 00:40.470
And once again, humanity could 
not stop a Titan invasion.

00:41.720 --> 00:45.200
Soldiers fell, one after the 
next, before the Titan assault.

00:46.050 --> 00:47.230
And then...

00:47.540 --> 00:49.650
Eren! Hurry!

00:53.780 --> 00:56.950
Eren Jaeger had been 
devoured by a Titan,

01:00.850 --> 01:05.050
but reappeared, emerging 
from a mysterious Titan.

01:07.370 --> 01:09.960
Attention!

01:10.810 --> 01:15.090
Dot Pixis, the high commander 
of the southern territories,

01:15.090 --> 01:19.690
recognized the combat potential 
of Eren's ability to become a Titan,

01:19.690 --> 01:23.040
and decided to execute 
an audacious plan.

01:24.080 --> 01:27.270
He will become a Titan, 
pick up the giant boulder

01:27.270 --> 01:29.270
by the shattered gate, carry it over,

01:29.270 --> 01:30.430
and seal the hole.

01:31.920 --> 01:34.050
When this mission succeeds,

01:34.050 --> 01:35.800
humanity will have retaken

01:35.800 --> 01:39.160
its territory from them 
for the very first time.

01:40.050 --> 01:43.120
But for humanity, that step will be

01:43.120 --> 01:44.830
a great advance in our 
attack on the Titans!

01:48.370 --> 01:54.000
However, as soon as it has begun, the mission 
already seems to be on the brink of failure...

03:27.970 --> 03:32.980
Wound 
The Battle for Trost (8)

03:36.020 --> 03:38.320
We've somehow managed

03:38.320 --> 03:41.030
to lure most of the Titans 
to the town's edge...

03:41.400 --> 03:44.030
But despite our best 
efforts to avoid combat,

03:44.280 --> 03:46.530
we've lost around twenty 
percent of our troops.

03:47.660 --> 03:49.670
We didn't lose them.

03:50.410 --> 03:52.790
Those soldiers didn't die on their own.

03:55.020 --> 03:57.960
They died due to my orders.

03:59.490 --> 04:02.360
This battle will decide 
humanity's survival.

04:02.920 --> 04:08.790
And to win, I am willing 
to be called a murderer.

04:26.490 --> 04:27.240
Ackerman!

04:40.080 --> 04:42.230
Hey! Ackerman, stop!

04:42.230 --> 04:43.760
Get away from him!

04:43.760 --> 04:46.290
Eren, don't you know who I am?

04:46.290 --> 04:47.510
It's me, Mikasa!

04:48.110 --> 04:50.280
Your family!

04:50.580 --> 04:53.730
You must use that boulder 
to seal the hole!

04:54.690 --> 04:56.230
The mission has failed.

04:56.980 --> 05:01.250
I knew there wasn't any secret weapon.

05:06.400 --> 05:08.390
Eren, you're human!

05:08.390 --> 05:09.070
You're...

05:09.890 --> 05:11.410
Move, Ackerman!

05:26.190 --> 05:27.630
What the?

05:28.050 --> 05:30.300
He's just like any other stupid Titan!

05:30.300 --> 05:30.960
Eren!

05:30.960 --> 05:32.260
Captain Ian!

05:32.730 --> 05:34.600
Two Titans approaching from the front!

05:34.600 --> 05:36.690
A 10-meter and a 6-meter class.

05:37.210 --> 05:38.560
Another from the rear, as well!

05:38.560 --> 05:40.980
One 12-meter class coming this way!

05:43.490 --> 05:45.070
Ian, we must retreat!

05:45.390 --> 05:46.650
Look at him!

05:46.650 --> 05:48.490
No way is that hole getting sealed!

05:48.490 --> 05:49.570
Yeah...

05:49.570 --> 05:52.450
We have no choice but to leave him here.

06:00.240 --> 06:03.170
Red smoke round from the 
elite force sighted.

06:03.170 --> 06:06.970
A serious problem has happened 
during the mission.

06:07.680 --> 06:08.840
We're dying for no reason.

06:09.200 --> 06:12.040
My friends died for nothing!

06:15.040 --> 06:16.680
Hey! Look at that!

06:16.870 --> 06:18.280
What? What is that?

06:19.240 --> 06:21.710
It... failed?

06:22.190 --> 06:23.320
Why?

06:27.880 --> 06:30.320
Hey, Armin! 
Where are you going?

06:31.050 --> 06:32.320
Commander Pixis,

06:32.840 --> 06:35.520
we should recall them 
to defend the gate.

06:35.850 --> 06:36.950
Shall I do it?

06:36.950 --> 06:37.870
No.

06:38.790 --> 06:40.840
Shouldn't we order the 
elite force to retreat?

06:40.840 --> 06:41.790
No.

06:41.790 --> 06:45.460
Continue drawing the Titans 
to the edge of town.

06:46.630 --> 06:50.340
The elite force has full 
tactical discretion.

06:50.860 --> 06:53.110
They are not simply excellent soldiers.

06:53.110 --> 06:56.840
They're the best of the best, 
entrusted with humanity's fate.

06:57.730 --> 07:01.400
For them to give up so easily 
would be unimaginable.

07:01.850 --> 07:05.090
They'll fight to the end...

07:06.010 --> 07:09.360
So the deaths of the fallen will 
not have been in vain.

07:10.450 --> 07:12.340
Hey, what's wrong?

07:12.340 --> 07:13.620
Give the order!

07:13.620 --> 07:15.540
Ian, it wasn't your fault!

07:15.960 --> 07:17.870
The plan was always a long shot.

07:18.410 --> 07:19.810
Everyone knew that.

07:19.810 --> 07:23.290
It was worth trying, and we 
took our best shot!

07:24.050 --> 07:26.670
Come on! Our squads will climb the walls.

07:29.760 --> 07:30.620
Wait!

07:31.470 --> 07:32.480
Wait...

07:32.480 --> 07:33.750
Calm down, Ackerman.

07:34.330 --> 07:37.090
Riko, your squad will handle the 
12-meter Titan behind us.

07:37.770 --> 07:40.130
Mitabi's squad and mine will 
take the two in front.

07:40.130 --> 07:41.300
What?

07:41.300 --> 07:43.520
I'm the one they left in charge!

07:43.520 --> 07:45.240
Shut up and follow your orders!

07:46.270 --> 07:48.980
We can't leave Jaeger defenseless.

07:50.180 --> 07:51.720
I'm changing the plan.

07:51.720 --> 07:55.050
We protect Jaeger from the Titans 
until we can retrieve him.

07:55.720 --> 07:57.950
He's still valuable as one 
of humanity's last hopes.

07:58.600 --> 08:00.670
We cannot just abandon him like this.

08:01.290 --> 08:04.960
We can be replaced, but he can't be.

08:05.390 --> 08:08.080
The failure of that 
dysfunctional human weapon

08:08.080 --> 08:10.980
has already cost several hundred lives!

08:10.980 --> 08:14.810
You're saying we should bring him 
back, so this can happen again?

08:14.810 --> 08:16.170
That's right.

08:16.170 --> 08:19.010
We must try as many times as necessary, 
regardless of the cost in lives!

08:25.910 --> 08:28.040
What happened to Eren?

08:28.500 --> 08:30.320
Armin's headed there by himself.

08:30.730 --> 08:32.840
He's probably all right.

08:33.150 --> 08:34.260
Probably?

08:34.260 --> 08:35.360
He's fine.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.120
I'm sure of it.

08:36.690 --> 08:38.030
Eren can do this.

08:39.760 --> 08:44.020
I think luring the Titans to the 
town's edge is useless.

08:44.020 --> 08:47.690
Any fight with Titans 
is a war of attrition.

08:47.690 --> 08:50.630
At this stage, they want to avoid 
the needless loss of troops.

08:53.200 --> 08:56.460
Then anyone who doesn't make it now 
will have died for nothing?

08:56.930 --> 08:58.690
Eventually, it will become an all-out war.

08:58.690 --> 09:01.360
But until then, we must 
preserve our forces.

09:01.360 --> 09:03.660
It's obvious that we should 
minimize casualties.

09:04.300 --> 09:05.560
The brass made the right call.

09:05.560 --> 09:07.140
Is that so, huh?

09:07.140 --> 09:08.400
It is!

09:09.220 --> 09:10.190
Anyway...

09:10.190 --> 09:14.040
Let's both ensure that we 
don't end up as casualties.

09:14.820 --> 09:16.730
Ian, are you serious?

09:16.730 --> 09:19.620
How else should humanity 
defeat the Titans?

09:19.620 --> 09:21.290
Riko, tell me!

09:21.730 --> 09:24.380
Is there any other way to get 
ourselves out of this mess?

09:24.830 --> 09:26.710
Some way to maintain our human dignity,

09:26.710 --> 09:27.790
without more deaths?!

09:28.100 --> 09:32.000
How can we counter the Titans' 
overwhelming advantage over us?

09:32.610 --> 09:36.330
As if I'd know of a way to defeat them!

09:37.060 --> 09:38.290
That's right...

09:38.850 --> 09:42.310
So for the moment, this is 
all we can and should do.

09:43.000 --> 09:45.810
We must be willing to sacrifice our lives

09:46.870 --> 09:50.110
and do our best for that 
incomprehensible human weapon.

09:51.390 --> 09:52.650
Pathetic, isn't it?

09:53.340 --> 09:56.520
But as humans, it's all we can do.

09:57.650 --> 09:59.810
Now, what will you do?

10:00.570 --> 10:02.870
This is the only battle we can fight.

10:03.730 --> 10:05.700
This is the struggle we've 
been allowed to engage.

10:16.050 --> 10:18.680
I can't accept that.

10:18.850 --> 10:20.070
Riko!

10:20.720 --> 10:22.430
I'll obey the order.

10:23.230 --> 10:25.890
I think what you're saying is right.

10:26.720 --> 10:29.640
But as we struggle our hardest, 
we'll also show them

10:29.640 --> 10:31.040
how terrifying humans can be.

10:31.660 --> 10:33.900
I refuse to die for nothing.

10:34.600 --> 10:38.040
Leave the 12-meter class 
behind us to my squad.

10:41.530 --> 10:42.620
Let's go.

10:42.620 --> 10:44.580
Our target will be the two in the front.

10:44.580 --> 10:45.410
Yeah.

10:48.790 --> 10:51.040
Thank you, Captain Ian.

10:51.040 --> 10:53.650
Ackerman, there's no need to thank me.

10:54.470 --> 10:57.970
I was terrified because there's 
no telling what you'll do.

10:58.710 --> 11:01.170
Do as you like, just as 
in the original plan.

11:01.170 --> 11:03.540
That will be a more efficient 
use of your abilities.

11:04.140 --> 11:04.970
Yes, sir.

11:05.640 --> 11:07.680
You have to protect your boyfriend.

11:08.430 --> 11:09.520
We're family.

11:16.130 --> 11:17.070
What?

11:17.770 --> 11:20.070
The damaged parts aren't regenerating?

11:20.660 --> 11:22.160
Is it due to the earlier damage he took?

11:24.870 --> 11:26.650
What will that do to Eren?

11:26.650 --> 11:30.910
And is there any guarantee 
he can regain human form?

11:32.250 --> 11:33.600
No, stop this.

11:33.600 --> 11:35.640
I will not be able to find 
answers to these questions.

11:36.290 --> 11:39.260
For now, I'll just do what I can.

11:47.970 --> 11:48.850
Eren...

11:49.140 --> 11:51.570
Mikasa! What happened?

12:05.950 --> 12:10.950
<b>Information We Can Share So Far:</b>

12:05.950 --> 12:10.950
<b>3D Maneuver Gear Weight-Shifting Device (3) 

Users must shift their entire weight to 
one side of their hips or the other. 
This permits acrobatic movement, 
but heavily taxes the muscles.</b>

12:10.950 --> 12:15.960
<b>Information We Can Share So Far:</b>

12:10.950 --> 12:15.960
<b>3D Maneuver Gear Training (3) 
For this reason, instructors will deliberately 
cut student lifelines to gauge reactions. 
While unsafe, anyone who dies during 
training would be unable to fight Titans anyway.</b>

12:20.000 --> 12:20.870
What?

12:21.740 --> 12:26.820
What... am I doing now?

12:27.740 --> 12:29.390
Am I sitting?

12:30.230 --> 12:31.780
I can't see a thing.

12:32.580 --> 12:34.140
What day is it?

12:35.810 --> 12:36.900
Where am I?

12:43.300 --> 12:44.410
Hmm?

12:45.510 --> 12:46.760
I'm at home?

12:53.950 --> 12:55.100
I'll go back to sleep.

13:02.850 --> 13:03.760
Eren!

13:05.690 --> 13:07.850
What are you doing, Eren?

13:09.530 --> 13:10.610
Listen up.

13:10.610 --> 13:14.330
You just need to keep the Titans 
in the corner of the city.

13:14.330 --> 13:17.510
Stay focused on that, 
and draw them there.

13:18.050 --> 13:19.310
Got it?

13:19.310 --> 13:21.490
You don't need to fight.

13:21.990 --> 13:24.820
Trainees, form groups of three 
and run along the ground.

13:25.180 --> 13:27.150
When you reach the wall, jump up.

13:27.150 --> 13:28.480
Don't get killed.

13:28.800 --> 13:31.680
If any Titans break away, 
we'll take care of them.

13:32.580 --> 13:34.130
"If"?

13:34.130 --> 13:36.700
Isn't it more of a "when" than an "if"?

13:36.700 --> 13:41.330
If we think we're in danger, 
can we deviate from our orders?

13:41.680 --> 13:43.630
If you believe it'll help.

13:46.170 --> 13:47.740
Kirschstein squad, go!

13:47.740 --> 13:48.590
Right!

14:07.880 --> 14:09.420
This is bad! Behind us!

14:10.490 --> 14:12.120
One 13-meter class!

14:12.120 --> 14:13.950
It's approaching Jaeger!

14:14.670 --> 14:17.210
More Titans coming through the hole!

14:18.130 --> 14:20.110
Four Titans, approximately 
10-meter class!

14:20.640 --> 14:22.410
Ackerman, take the one behind us!

14:22.410 --> 14:23.310
Got it.

14:23.310 --> 14:25.320
Don't let it near Jaeger!

14:25.900 --> 14:27.190
We'll stop them here!

14:27.190 --> 14:27.970
Right!

14:28.570 --> 14:31.710
Even if they are elite, two squads 
can't handle four at once...

14:47.340 --> 14:48.550
No...

14:48.920 --> 14:50.700
Why are there so many Titans?

14:51.490 --> 14:53.380
There aren't too many people there.

14:53.940 --> 14:57.240
Could Eren be drawing them?

14:57.640 --> 14:58.530
Mikasa!

14:59.350 --> 15:00.680
What happened to the plan?

15:00.680 --> 15:01.810
Armin!

15:01.810 --> 15:03.540
What happened to Eren?

15:04.020 --> 15:05.810
It's dangerous! Move back!

15:05.810 --> 15:08.890
Eren is completely unable to enact 
his will through that Titan!

15:08.890 --> 15:11.300
I spoke to it, but it 
didn't recognize me!

15:11.520 --> 15:13.630
There's no point in anyone else trying!

15:13.630 --> 15:14.700
What about the plan?

15:14.700 --> 15:16.200
It failed.

15:16.200 --> 15:19.220
Everyone's fighting because 
we can't leave Eren.

15:19.220 --> 15:21.060
But there are too many...

15:21.430 --> 15:23.960
Before long, they'll wipe us out.

15:34.990 --> 15:37.260
The spot on the back of the neck,

15:37.930 --> 15:41.060
ten centimeters across and a meter high.

15:41.720 --> 15:42.710
Armin!

15:42.710 --> 15:44.880
I'll get Eren out of here!

15:44.880 --> 15:47.590
You protect us from any Titans!

15:48.770 --> 15:49.880
What are you saying?

15:50.830 --> 15:53.920
Eren came out of the 
Titan's vital point.

15:55.440 --> 16:00.220
It's probably related to the 
mystery behind them.

16:00.990 --> 16:01.740
Don't worry.

16:02.140 --> 16:04.140
As long as I avoid striking 
it in the center,

16:05.560 --> 16:07.330
he won't die.

16:07.330 --> 16:09.720
It'll just hurt...

16:10.570 --> 16:11.820
a tiny bit!

16:11.820 --> 16:12.700
Armin...

16:23.020 --> 16:24.880
Armin, that's insane! Stop!

16:24.880 --> 16:28.050
Mikasa, do what you can!

16:28.050 --> 16:30.380
If you go, some lives might be saved!

16:30.670 --> 16:32.980
Leave Eren to me!

16:40.450 --> 16:42.270
Eren, can you hear me?

16:42.950 --> 16:44.580
Come to your senses!

16:44.580 --> 16:47.190
If we don't get out of 
here, we'll all die!

16:47.800 --> 16:50.160
Don't let the Titan's body take over!

16:50.160 --> 16:54.200
Just come out of that 
lump of flesh, now!

16:54.790 --> 16:56.730
Come out?

16:57.610 --> 16:58.640
Why?

16:59.500 --> 17:02.200
I'm tired...

17:02.200 --> 17:04.720
Eren! Get out of there!

17:04.720 --> 17:05.930
Hurry!

17:05.930 --> 17:08.540
Eren! Eren!

17:12.810 --> 17:15.340
What happened to avenging your mother?

17:15.790 --> 17:18.210
Aren't you going to wipe out the Titans?

17:18.220 --> 17:21.660
Don't you hate the things 
that killed your mother?

17:22.830 --> 17:25.130
What are you talking about, Armin?

17:26.620 --> 17:29.250
Mom's right here...

17:30.210 --> 17:32.080
Eren! Eren!

17:32.080 --> 17:33.920
Wake up, Eren!

17:33.920 --> 17:36.360
You're still in there, aren't you?

17:36.620 --> 17:39.510
If we stay here, the 
Titans will kill us!

17:39.890 --> 17:41.870
Everything will end here!

17:43.760 --> 17:45.280
Like I said...

17:45.280 --> 17:47.960
I don't understand you, Armin.

17:50.700 --> 17:53.390
Why do I have to leave?

17:53.880 --> 17:54.880
Yeah...

17:55.610 --> 17:57.400
Why would I want to leave?

18:01.610 --> 18:03.560
Why would I want to 
join the Survey Corps?

18:13.240 --> 18:16.320
Looks like we have to deviate 
from the plan, like it or not.

18:27.060 --> 18:28.340
Gotcha!

18:34.810 --> 18:37.310
So you're finally down, bastard?

18:42.990 --> 18:44.330
Fall back for now!

18:44.330 --> 18:45.890
I'm here.

18:46.240 --> 18:47.860
I'll join up with Mitabi's squad.

18:58.120 --> 18:58.870
What?!

19:05.090 --> 19:05.740
Jean!

19:06.010 --> 19:07.410
Hurry! Go!

19:11.170 --> 19:13.840
I won't let anyone else 
die because of me!

19:29.210 --> 19:31.350
Damn it... A malfunction, 
at a time like this?

19:50.340 --> 19:51.040
Jean!

19:56.720 --> 19:57.630
What's wrong?

19:58.580 --> 20:00.810
Why isn't he using his Maneuver Gear?

20:02.110 --> 20:05.110
No way... Is it broken?

20:06.450 --> 20:07.930
I'll come up with something!

20:20.040 --> 20:21.310
Damn it.

20:21.310 --> 20:23.470
Why am I the one slowing us down?

20:37.260 --> 20:40.070
Can I really come up with something?

20:43.570 --> 20:44.570
Eren...

20:45.590 --> 20:46.530
Eren!

20:47.400 --> 20:48.420
Eren!

20:50.250 --> 20:51.330
Eren!

20:52.940 --> 20:57.610
One day, we're going to explore 
the outside world, right?

21:00.170 --> 21:03.300
Far beyond these walls

21:04.130 --> 21:06.780
is flaming water! Frozen earth!

21:07.990 --> 21:10.280

Snow-white plains of sand!

21:11.050 --> 21:14.450
The world my mom and dad tried to see...

21:19.490 --> 21:21.610
I thought maybe you'd forgotten.

21:22.540 --> 21:24.860
But the reason you stopped mentioning it

21:24.860 --> 21:28.200
was because you didn't want me 
to join the Survey Corps, right?

21:29.400 --> 21:31.910
The outside world?

21:35.650 --> 21:37.910
Eren... Answer me!

21:38.600 --> 21:42.750
You knew that hell was one 
step beyond the walls.

21:43.630 --> 21:48.030
You might die horribly, 
like my mom and dad did.

21:48.960 --> 21:53.310
So why did you want to go?

21:56.590 --> 21:58.040
Why?

21:59.420 --> 22:02.340
You know why.

22:05.240 --> 22:08.590
Because I was born into this world!

23:53.620 --> 23:56.050
Go. Run. Live.

23:57.040 --> 23:59.270
Those words fill the air,

23:59.270 --> 24:01.670
as many lives are lost 
on the battlefield.

24:02.380 --> 24:06.060
Eren heads for the gate, 
carrying hope with him.

24:05.380 --> 24:07.960
Primal Desires
The Battle for Trost (9)
